<title>POLAND: POLL - Polish zloty seen at 3.4743 vs dlr end-97.</title>
<headline>POLL - Polish zloty seen at 3.4743 vs dlr end-97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish zloty is seen easing against the dollar by the end of the year and the prediction is more pessimistic than last month, according to a Reuter poll of the country's 25 largest banks.</p>
<p>On Thursday the zloty was fixed at 3.3045 to the dollar.</p>
<p>		    JULY	  END-97	   12-MONTHS AHEAD</p>
<p> USD/PLN AVG   3.3182    3.4743 (3.3907)   3.6420 (3.5385)</p>
<p>     MINIMUM   3.2700    3.3500 (3.2700)   3.4000 (3.3000)</p>
<p>     MAXIMUM   3.3480    3.6108 (3.5200)   4.0351 (3.7500)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets previous figures for end-97 and June-98 from last month's poll.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
